## GJS Connection Ecosystem

**Juggernaut OS + CrewAI + Ollama AI Agent Ecosystem**

## 🎯 Purpose
Open-source AI agent framework connecting Juggernaut OS orchestration with autonomous agents powered by local LLMs.

## 🏗️ Architecture
- **Orchestration**: Juggernaut OS
- **Agent Execution**: CrewAI
- **AI Models**: Ollama (Llama 3.1/Mistral)
- **Automation**: n8n workflows
- **Database**: Supabase

